lunduke-edit (0.9-7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * After a stat failure, Enter runs Save As. The question no longer
    offers a Save that cannot write the path.
  * Opening a large file reads in the background and fills the buffer in
    idle slices, with a busy cursor and a status line. Cancel and close
    during the load leave the previous text in place.
  * Replace All is one buffer edit and one undo step.
  * Typing at the end of a very long line stays on a short visible slice.
    Wrap stays off for that line.
  * The first-run menus are File, Edit, Search, Text, and Help. Encoding
    and Open Next File As are section titles. The next-file choices have
    their own mnemonics.
  * Don't Find is gone. Cancel closes Find & Replace.
  * Dropping a file on the window opens it.

