lunduke-edit (0.9-6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Text inserted at the start of the buffer, or anywhere it matches the
    text already there, keeps the editor font. Typing, paste, undo, redo,
    open, reload, replace-all, and drag-and-drop all use that face. The
    font is not written into the file.
  * A printed page counts the height already laid out, including tabs,
