lunduke-edit (0.9-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A clean file that was deleted on disk is marked unsaved. Close and
    quit ask before dropping the text, and Save writes the buffer back.
    A stat failure other than a missing file is reported, and is not
    treated as an unchanged file.
  * Text → Font changes the face and the size of the text being edited.
    The choice is saved and used for printing. With no choice, the
    editor stays monospace at 11 pt.
  * Opening a path from another window, or from a second launch, reloads
    that file when it changed on disk.
  * Find Next does not stay inside the match Find just selected. Extend
    Selection turns off when the Find dialog closes.
  * A middle-button double-click or triple-click pastes once.
  * After Reload, Don't Save is the default and loads the file on disk.
    Save says that it replaces the file and cancels the reload.
  * Ordinary printed lines stay inside the page.

